abstract: >-
  Data-retrieval and analysis code (Python and R) and processed datasets
  underlying every table and figure in "Tokenized Treasuries Across Asset
  Classes," submitted to Investment Analysts Journal. Covers AR-GARCH-family
  marginal models, two-stage DCC/ADCC, a Kalman-filtered TVP-VAR with
  Baruník-Křehlík frequency-domain decomposition, Bai-Perron structural
  breaks, moving block-bootstrap intervals, two-state Markov-switching
  regimes, wavelet and partial wavelet coherence, and DCC-implied hedge
  ratios, applied to tokenized Treasury products (BUIDL, OUSG, sUSDS) against
  technology equities, native crypto, DeFi governance tokens, and gold.
